  <translations>
    <en>
      <description>Rain Bird R-VAN-18F is a rotary nozzle designed to deliver controlled, water-efficient irrigation for landscaped areas. Multiple rotating streams apply water more slowly than many conventional spray nozzles, helping the soil absorb it and reducing runoff when the system is correctly designed. The stated coverage is 4.0–5.5 m; the watering pattern is 360°; recommended operating pressure is 2.1–3.8 bar.

R-VAN nozzles are useful for matching irrigation coverage to the shape of the planting area, including standard arcs and narrow strips. Select the pattern to suit the location and maintain compatible pressure and flow. Use with compatible Rain Bird 1800/RD1800 spray bodies or other approved bodies as specified by the manufacturer.

Actual radius and uniformity depend on pressure, spacing, soil and wind conditions.</description>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-h1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-h1s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Multi-stream rotary nozzle for uniform coverage</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p1s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Rain Bird R-VAN-18F</text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p1s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text> is a multi-stream rotary nozzle designed to provide uniform lawn coverage. Its larger water droplets hold their trajectory better in light wind, while matched precipitation helps simplify irrigation-zone design.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-h2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-h2s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Technical specifications of R-VAN-18F</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p2s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Technical data: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p2s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>recommended sprinkler spacing 4.0–5.5 m m; fixed 360° full-circle pattern; operating pressure 2.1–3.8 bar, recommended 3.1 bar.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-h3</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-h3s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Arc and radius adjustment</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p3</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p3s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Adjustment: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p3s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>The arc is fixed at 360°; the radius is adjusted while the system is running. Settings are made by hand without special tools; pull the nozzle up for flushing as directed by the manufacturer.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-h4</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-h4s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>R-VAN compatibility and features</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p4</_key>
