          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p4s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>The R-VAN family provides high uniformity and matched precipitation across its models. For optimum performance at the recommended pressure, use a compatible Rain Bird 1800 PRS-45 spray body.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
