          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Design, installation and maintenance</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p5</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p5s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>For system design: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>816a0665-1e3e-484c-b08f-fdcf8a68e9d2-en-p5s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>follow the recommended spacing for the selected model and check pressure with the zone operating. Adjust the arc and radius while water is flowing so the actual coverage edge can be observed. See </text>
        </children>
