      <name>Rain Bird R-VAN-18F — 360° rotary nozzle</name>
      <seo>
        <h1>Rain Bird R-VAN-18F — 360° rotary nozzle</h1>
        <metaDescription>For sale: Rain Bird R-VAN-18F — 360° rotary nozzle. Rotary nozzle with fixed 360° arc and 4.2–5.5 m radius. Florial, Burgas.</metaDescription>
